    "message": "Document AI features for Platform cloud storage integrations (#26853)\n\nDocuments the AI features switch and write access for Platform cloud storage integrations (ultralytics/portal#4848, #4853).\n\nThe Amazon S3, Google Cloud Storage, and Azure Blob Storage pages explain what AI features cover, how admins turn them off, and what still works when they're off. They also cover write access for image generation, including a scoped S3 policy and the reconnect step for older connections, and they include refreshed settings screenshots. The integrations index, datasets, annotation, API reference (Set AI Features, 409 reasons), and On Premise pages are updated to match.",
